  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">External technical support for Due Diligence</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">To provide high quality technical support and consultancy for FCDO due diligence assessments and headquarters assessments. The headquarters assessments produced will work towards meeting the commitments within the International Development Strategy of completing twelve headquarter assessments with the aim of making the FCDO due diligence process more efficient and reducing duplication of workload with the department and for delivery partners.</narrative>
  </description>
